    %% CLASS DIAGRAM, PART 1 OF 2: SERVICES FOR THE 35 CURRENT USER STORIES
    %% Part 2 (data models) is UML_Class_Diagram_Models.mmd.
    %% Source: docs/user-stories.md.
    %% How to read this diagram:
    %% - A class with the stereotype <<new ...>> is proposed. It shows the stories.
    %% - The block between the GENERATED markers is made from the code by
    %%   `npm run diagrams` (tools/diagrams/src/config.mjs lists the modules).
    %%   Do not edit it, except to add a [CHANGE x.y.z] tag at the end of a line.
    %%   The generator keeps such tags.
    %% - Proposed operations of an existing class are in a second block of that
    %%   class below the markers, with [NEW x.y.z]. Mermaid joins both blocks.
    %%   When the code gets the operation, the generator removes the proposed line.
    %% - [CHANGE x.y.z] is an existing operation that a story changes.
    %% - A route class is one route.ts file. The stereotype gives the path.
    %%   The operations are the HTTP handlers. The parameters are the path
    %%   segments, the query keys and "body". The result is the keys of the JSON.
    %% - Proposed operation names are the same as in the Sequence_US_*.mmd files.
    %% - Only the classes that a story touches are shown. Existing code that
    %%   no story touches is not shown: webapp/utils/form-actions.ts,
    %%   webapp/utils/admin-actions.ts, the heatmap route, /api/gallery,
    %%   /api/homepage-images, /api/user-gallery/*, /api/openapi and
    %%   webapp/lib/swagger.ts, /auth/callback, /auth/confirm, the other
    %%   functions in queries.ts, resendConfirmation, getAuthState,
    %%   subscribeToAuth and notifyListeners in webapp/services/auth.ts,
    %%   FNR/src/services/database.ts, FNR/src/services/pdfGenerator.ts,
    %%   FNR/src/services/adminAuth.ts.
    %% - webapp/app/login/actions.ts (login, loginGithub) is not shown.
    %%   Nothing in webapp/ imports it.
    %% - The web app uses its own tables. The mobile app uses the legacy
    %%   tables. See ER_Diagram.mmd and ER_Diagram_Legacy.mmd.

